cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the released predictions, please cite it as below, and cite PhosphoSitePlus (see NOTICE)."
title: "ksp: kinase-substrate site prediction across the human proteome (AI-agent research exercise)"
abstract: "Start with the research briefing (briefing/briefing.html): a plain-language account of the study, its results and its limits. The repository holds the code, released predictions and design record for a kinase-substrate site predictor (late fusion of a LightGBM pair model and a neural model with Cantley-atlas distillation) built and evaluated by AI agents under a human-written brief. Predictions are derived from PhosphoSitePlus labels and are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 3.0."
type: software
